WEBVTT

00:02.171 --> 00:07.139
<i>The children who survived by hiding underground
had talked about their dreams to each other</i>

00:07.139 --> 00:10.312
<i>in order to slow down the countdown
and prevented themselves from turning into zombies.</i>

00:10.772 --> 00:15.907
<i>In the town, Andy and the resident zombies
were working together to fight against Spoil.</i>

00:16.449 --> 00:23.380
<i>Amid the fierce battle, Andy notices that
giving zombies Fuko’s unluck can damage Spoil.</i>

00:24.298 --> 00:28.933
<i>The female zombie who used to be
the children’s teacher takes initiative and touches Fuko first,</i>

00:29.100 --> 00:33.066
<i>standing against Spoil and bursting as a bomb of unluck.</i>

00:33.609 --> 00:37.366
<i>Though sad, Fuko wipes her tears
and accepts her determination.</i>

00:38.451 --> 00:41.291
<i>Spoil has transformed into
its second form, Phase 2,</i>

00:41.709 --> 00:44.548
<i>and unleashes an even more evil power of spoilage.</i>

00:44.923 --> 00:51.436
<i>Fuko doesn’t flinch even against Spoil,
speaking of her dreams to overcome the countdown.</i>

00:52.146 --> 00:58.659
<i>Shen’s attack is unleashed in that very moment...
will it become the beacon for counter attack?</i>

01:01.289 --> 01:02.416
Andy!

01:03.919 --> 01:06.132
Wicked, to coin a phrase, dear Fuko!

01:06.382 --> 01:09.096
Oh, and as for my dream?

01:12.102 --> 01:14.190
To be the greatest
in all of creation!

01:37.737 --> 01:38.488
Mr. Shen!

01:38.488 --> 01:41.704
Shen! Don’t get too close
or you‘ll start spoilin’!

01:42.079 --> 01:44.458
I’ll be fine, Mr. Andy!

01:44.458 --> 01:46.170
I've sorta figured it out!

01:48.634 --> 01:52.349
Spoil brought its face near Fuko earlier, but...

01:52.349 --> 01:54.145
...she didn’t start to spoil!

01:54.646 --> 01:58.612
<i>My guess is that its spoil field
is generated around its body!</i>

01:59.948 --> 02:02.161
And that’s why Fuko was safe!

02:04.833 --> 02:07.839
<i>But the moment it draws its head back in...</i>

02:07.839 --> 02:09.467
<i>...no more weakness!</i>

02:12.682 --> 02:15.772
That’s where this Artifact comes in...
the Nyoi-Kinko staff!

02:17.107 --> 02:18.819
EXTEND!!
Shēnzhan!

02:25.541 --> 02:27.629
It’s the Nyoi-bo Staff!
From “Journey to the West”!

02:27.629 --> 02:30.217
If ya had that the whole damn time,
ya shoulda used it sooner!

02:30.383 --> 02:33.766
It’s thanks to you that I figured out
that I could, Mr. Andy.

02:34.976 --> 02:35.853
SHRINK
Shōusuō!

02:37.064 --> 02:37.982
THANK YOU
Xièxiè!

02:39.443 --> 02:41.907
<i>Artifact: Nyoi-Kinko Staff.</i>

02:42.324 --> 02:46.290
<i>Excavated from China...
this bo staff can expand and contract at will.</i>

02:49.380 --> 02:50.925
Why, you...

02:51.133 --> 02:52.637
You expect me to just stand here...

02:52.637 --> 02:54.348
...and take this?

02:55.518 --> 02:58.273
What’s going on?

02:58.273 --> 03:02.865
Why does my body...
approach you on its own?

03:03.659 --> 03:05.328
Poor thing.

03:05.580 --> 03:07.792
Betcha wanted to avoid that one...
didn’t ya?

03:11.550 --> 03:14.931
<i>Shen’s ability acts on a target
in his field of vision.</i>

03:14.931 --> 03:19.356
<i>Which forces the target to perform
the opposite of any action it was trying to make.</i>

03:21.612 --> 03:23.866
I can’t figure his ability out.

03:23.949 --> 03:26.705
I need to retreat for now.

03:28.082 --> 03:31.798
<i>Any conscious thought that enters
the target’s mind...</i>

03:33.761 --> 03:35.681
<i>...is negated by Shen.</i>

03:36.140 --> 03:39.814
<i>However, to activate this activity,
a certain condition...</i>

03:39.814 --> 03:42.027
<i>...must be subconsciously fulfilled by the user.</i>

03:42.027 --> 03:45.743
<i>The user... must become fond of his target.</i>

03:46.703 --> 03:50.418
Shen! How are we supposed
to catch the likes of these?

03:50.418 --> 03:52.339
Great, you’re healing.

03:52.339 --> 03:54.301
Whadduya do after ya weaken it?

03:54.301 --> 03:57.307
There should be a core within its body!

03:58.142 --> 04:02.902
While I’d love to pluck it out,
any living being that gets close to it will spoil.

04:03.612 --> 04:07.285
If only there was some way
to block his spoil ability...

04:09.164 --> 04:12.964
Don’t keep pushing your luck-

04:14.258 --> 04:15.970
I can’t fire.

04:16.345 --> 04:18.391
A disintegration laser for distant targets...

04:23.234 --> 04:27.869
...and an ability that spoils those that get close,
more powerful than Mr. Andy's regeneration!

04:34.966 --> 04:36.093
EXCELLENT
Jīngcai!

04:36.970 --> 04:41.855
Enough of your games!
I refuse to believe a glitch like this exists!

04:41.855 --> 04:43.817
Just a simple glance...

04:43.817 --> 04:47.658
...from a mere vessel, could never
pull off a feat of this magnitude!

04:48.619 --> 04:49.829
THANK YOU Xièxiè.

04:50.873 --> 04:53.796
Thanks to your overwhelming power...

04:56.927 --> 04:59.557
...that I may finally be able to see him.

06:44.811 --> 06:47.316
Stop its spoiling ability...

06:47.650 --> 06:49.403
...how can we do that?

06:49.821 --> 06:53.787
Spoil, or decomposition,
occurs due to bacteria in the air.

06:54.455 --> 06:56.835
But those bacteria need moisture.

06:57.294 --> 07:00.133
So, what if we reduce
the amount of moisture in the air?

07:01.260 --> 07:04.893
All righty. Guess I’ll try settin’ off
some more explosions!

07:06.020 --> 07:06.813
Wha-?

07:07.147 --> 07:09.611
Hey! Why are you pinching my belly?

07:09.611 --> 07:12.282
Why? Well, it’s spillin’ out.

07:12.282 --> 07:13.786
I-It is not spilling out!

07:13.994 --> 07:16.248
Yeah, it is. Quite a bit.

07:21.843 --> 07:25.100
I can’t help it!
Lately, food tastes good!

07:28.022 --> 07:32.782
Shen! Gain some distance!
I’m gonna nail ‘im with the gunpowder storehouse.

07:33.032 --> 07:35.286
Oh, I assume you’ve figured out something?

07:36.832 --> 07:37.917
The ground...

07:40.296 --> 07:43.010
No way. This is the last thing I expected.

07:48.689 --> 07:49.607
Fool.

07:49.774 --> 07:50.441
Uh-oh.

07:56.328 --> 08:01.631
<i>It destroyed the buildings... I see...
It’s using the dust clouds to obstruct my vision!</i>

08:02.340 --> 08:04.596
<i>A counter to my ability!</i>

08:04.596 --> 08:06.015
EXCELLENT
<i>Jīngcai!</i>

08:06.516 --> 08:08.394
Yow, ow, ow...

08:09.564 --> 08:10.356
Hmm?

08:12.319 --> 08:16.327
Spoil's up to something!

08:17.287 --> 08:18.582
Fuko!

08:19.208 --> 08:20.920
Mr. Shen! What about space?

08:21.295 --> 08:25.512
Space is a vacuum and devoid of moisture,
so nothing would spoil there.

08:25.512 --> 08:28.936
If we were to use the organization’s UFO
to send Spoil into space...

08:28.936 --> 08:32.985
Oh, but... I guess we wouldn’t be able
to survive out there.

08:33.654 --> 08:35.031
I see.

08:36.158 --> 08:37.327
Space, eh?

08:38.246 --> 08:39.582
<i>Well, what should we do?</i>

08:42.588 --> 08:46.763
I could lift both you and Spoil up
to space, if you’d like.

08:46.763 --> 08:47.848
How about it, Mr. Andy?

08:48.432 --> 08:54.319
But since you’ll be traveling together,
you’ll need to endure his Spoil ability until you reach space.

08:55.531 --> 08:58.035
Why don’t you pull that card out?

08:58.954 --> 09:02.002
<i>I bet the old you could endure it, right?</i>

09:04.549 --> 09:06.970
<i>Usually, I don’t have enough space for it all.</i>

09:06.970 --> 09:08.849
<i>So I put a cork in my brain...</i>

09:08.974 --> 09:11.896
<i>...to keep 100 years’ worth of memories bottled up!</i>

09:13.190 --> 09:14.109
Fine, it’s a deal.

09:16.656 --> 09:18.451
But I’ve got some stipulations.

09:24.212 --> 09:25.507
UNDERSTOOD
Míngbáile.

09:27.135 --> 09:28.012
SHRINK
Shōusuō.

09:31.393 --> 09:32.312
Mui, dear?

09:32.938 --> 09:35.234
Can you pinpoint its location from above?

09:35.903 --> 09:36.738
Yes, sir...

09:36.988 --> 09:40.495
It’s currently compressing a mass
of energy behind the smoke screen!

09:40.495 --> 09:41.790
Please flee the area-

09:41.790 --> 09:44.378
Just give me its exact coordinates.

09:49.304 --> 09:52.268
North 3-6-1-1, 4-1.

09:52.268 --> 09:54.816
West 1-1-5, 1-3-1-3.

09:55.191 --> 09:56.778
Well, you heard her, Mr. Andy.

09:57.112 --> 09:59.241
Yeah... I see ‘im.

09:59.826 --> 10:02.122
Then I leave the rest in your capable hands.

10:02.122 --> 10:02.832
Huh?

10:05.002 --> 10:06.422
EXTEND
Shēnzhan!

10:07.508 --> 10:08.552
Huh?

10:10.597 --> 10:12.016
You better win.

10:13.227 --> 10:14.479
ROGER
Zhīdàole.

10:27.631 --> 10:30.094
Isn’t that the card Andy
keeps lodged in his forehead?

10:31.430 --> 10:35.981
He pulled it out? But Andy said
if he removed it, he’d “go off the rails”!

10:35.981 --> 10:37.317
I’m aware.

10:37.943 --> 10:39.989
Fuko, don’t you also want to witness it?

10:44.498 --> 10:45.918
The man...

10:45.918 --> 10:50.636
...who once brought victory
to countless battlefields.

10:55.604 --> 10:57.525
I see your plan now.

10:58.695 --> 11:03.747
You thought this would disable
my ability, Undead?

11:04.749 --> 11:08.047
Unfortunately, in this form I not only
have spoilage at my disposal...

11:08.047 --> 11:12.347
...but also a beam that disintegrates anything it touches.

11:13.391 --> 11:14.434
<i>Spoil.</i>

11:14.769 --> 11:16.898
<i>You’re strong and righteous.</i>

11:18.777 --> 11:20.113
<i>But, even so...</i>

11:23.160 --> 11:27.043
<i>You can’t possibly tie me down.</i>

11:27.878 --> 11:31.511
Grk... What is with that regeneration speed?

11:32.095 --> 11:34.141
<i>Right, I’m supposed to take your core.</i>

11:38.441 --> 11:39.234
DIVISION BULLET

11:39.318 --> 11:40.946
<i>Division Bullet!</i>

11:43.702 --> 11:46.332
Each finger regenerated on its own?

11:58.941 --> 12:00.569
<i>Now then, let’s have...</i>

12:04.451 --> 12:06.080
<i>...a little fun.</i>

12:20.901 --> 12:23.114
Master Shen, preparations are complete.

12:23.699 --> 12:24.826
ROGER
Zhīdàole.

12:26.621 --> 12:27.497
Ken.

12:31.422 --> 12:36.725
If you walk straight from here,
people from our organization will rescue you.

12:36.725 --> 12:42.528
But Fuko and I can’t go together with you,
because we have things left to do.

12:43.154 --> 12:44.489
You understand, right?

12:46.619 --> 12:53.174
So please, protect everyone for just
a little while longer. Can I ask you to do that?

12:57.641 --> 12:58.434
Yup!

13:01.231 --> 13:03.779
Now, let’s get you away from here.

13:05.949 --> 13:08.622
Let’s go, guys. Come on!

13:12.546 --> 13:13.632
Yup!

13:20.979 --> 13:22.357
IT’LL BE ALL RIGHT
Mao wèn tí.

13:22.398 --> 13:27.450
The Union is tracing all of them,
and most of all Mui’s preparations are impeccable!

13:28.662 --> 13:29.371
Yup!

13:32.795 --> 13:34.297
Oh! He’s here!

13:34.297 --> 13:35.759
You mean Andy?

14:21.393 --> 14:23.230
Fuko, stand back.

14:24.776 --> 14:28.951
Mui, we’ve secured Spoil’s core.
Please beam it up.

14:29.242 --> 14:30.370
ROGER
Zhīdàole.

14:34.545 --> 14:37.008
What year and month is it?

14:38.219 --> 14:41.643
August 24th, 2020.

14:42.603 --> 14:43.689
What day of the week is it?

14:44.147 --> 14:46.987
Day of the week?
What’re you talking about?

14:47.947 --> 14:49.199
I see.

14:50.118 --> 14:52.915
Looks like they’ve got
a half-decent lineup here.

14:53.792 --> 14:59.136
<i>What is this? It's less like his memories are back,
but more like he's a different person.</i>

15:01.223 --> 15:05.649
You idiot... you don’t get another turn!

15:05.983 --> 15:07.778
You’ve been wasting your life away anyway.

15:08.070 --> 15:11.745
Give up! No matter what you do, I can’t die.

15:13.080 --> 15:14.667
I see.

15:18.633 --> 15:20.011
So it’s your fault...

15:21.263 --> 15:23.977
External-targeter... Unluck.

15:25.731 --> 15:26.440
Move aside.

15:26.775 --> 15:30.156
Pleased to meet you,
God of Victory-Victhor.

15:30.657 --> 15:32.912
I don’t know who told you about me.

15:32.912 --> 15:36.126
But I am Victor-a human.

15:36.126 --> 15:37.588
VIC·​TOR (VIK-TƏR)
NOUN: ONE THAT DEFEATS AN ENEMY OR OPPONENT : WINNER

15:37.922 --> 15:38.799
I am not Thor-a god.

15:38.882 --> 15:40.093
THOR (’THOR), NOUN:
THE NORSE GOD OF THUNDER, WEATHER, AND CROPS
I am not Thor-a god.

15:42.515 --> 15:43.265
Wha?

15:44.184 --> 15:46.523
<i>But I activated my ability!</i>

15:46.523 --> 15:48.109
<i>I even read the trajectory of his strike.</i>

15:48.652 --> 15:50.404
<i>I should have parried that attack.</i>

15:51.490 --> 15:53.285
<i>His strength is unreal!</i>

15:53.662 --> 15:57.753
<i>He’s so strong that his limbs break
each time he strikes.</i>

15:58.337 --> 16:00.424
<i>No human is capable of this kind of attack!</i>

16:01.511 --> 16:05.434
<i>People unconsciously exercise a level of control in
the interest of self-preservation.</i>

16:05.434 --> 16:08.065
<i>But not him-he’s broken free of that!</i>

16:08.065 --> 16:09.777
Good reactions.

16:09.777 --> 16:13.117
Pretty impressive-for someone with one life to live.

16:15.873 --> 16:18.169
M-Mr. Shen!

16:24.055 --> 16:25.016
Take that!

16:40.463 --> 16:41.799
Huh?

16:41.799 --> 16:43.302
Why isn’t my unluck...

16:58.249 --> 16:59.084
So I see.

17:01.129 --> 17:04.720
Mui... Relay this... message.

17:06.014 --> 17:09.271
Using bodily contact to induce strokes of unluck...

17:09.271 --> 17:12.235
...the force of which fluctuates based
on how well you like the target.

17:12.778 --> 17:16.703
A meteorite... a volcano... pathetic.

17:20.293 --> 17:24.467
Did you think I would succumb to such a paltry Rule?

17:25.219 --> 17:28.560
Now I see what you were up to while I
was locked away.

17:29.185 --> 17:33.152
Give up. You can’t kill me.

17:33.360 --> 17:35.031
Or what?

17:35.699 --> 17:37.327
If she were to die right now...

17:37.745 --> 17:39.999
...would you fall into despair?

17:43.297 --> 17:44.800
Do you hear that, Andy?

17:46.888 --> 17:50.186
At this rate, this guy’ll kill me!

17:50.646 --> 17:54.319
There’s more... so much more...

17:55.446 --> 18:01.542
...we were going to travel, do all kinds
of things... and fall in love...

18:02.711 --> 18:05.634
There are even greater strokes
of unluck to uncover!

18:05.884 --> 18:09.140
Are you okay with it?
For me to die first?

18:09.140 --> 18:11.521
You have to come back, Andy!

18:16.071 --> 18:21.331
You idiot. Rules are absolute.
No matter what happens, I won’t-

18:21.331 --> 18:23.001
I wonder about that!

18:23.377 --> 18:28.345
In that fight against Spoil,
I saw the power of human potential!

18:28.847 --> 18:32.855
Well, I lost!
Today ended up being a fantastic day!

18:32.855 --> 18:33.815
THANKS
Xièxiè!

18:34.525 --> 18:37.238
This’ll help me get stronger for sure!

18:37.238 --> 18:40.453
I’d love to duke it out some more,
but I’m too weak!

18:42.039 --> 18:46.674
So I’d better hurry up and honor
the two promises I made to Mr. Andy.

18:46.674 --> 18:49.053
Promise one... “Protect the brat.”

18:51.851 --> 18:53.771
Eight Cycle Mountain Strike!

18:54.523 --> 18:59.950
<i>This is the most stalling for time...
that I can do right now.</i>

19:00.535 --> 19:04.919
The other promise... “Beat me.”

19:07.508 --> 19:08.593
It really is a shame...

19:10.889 --> 19:12.726
But I’ll have to count on you guys.

19:17.694 --> 19:20.659
I must say... you’re one troublesome rookie.

19:20.992 --> 19:24.708
Everyone! Andy, he’s... he’s...

19:24.708 --> 19:26.921
Don’t worry. Leave it to them.

19:28.215 --> 19:29.885
We’re pretty darn strong!

19:32.056 --> 19:33.977
So... ten in total, eh?

19:35.647 --> 19:37.901
Then let’s see what you can do.

19:41.909 --> 19:44.874
Parts Bullet... Fingers!

19:48.506 --> 19:50.552
Each member has a shield?

19:51.177 --> 19:54.225
You morons! Don’t defend, attack!

19:54.225 --> 19:57.774
What’s the point in falling back in
a fight between ability users?

20:05.289 --> 20:05.832
<i>Ricochets!</i>

20:06.876 --> 20:10.884
<i>So this shield setup isn’t just a defensive tactic...
it’s also preparing an offense!</i>

20:17.939 --> 20:19.275
Nice.

20:21.237 --> 20:23.241
Not half bad!

20:24.870 --> 20:26.749
<i>Trying to bisect me, huh?</i>

20:26.749 --> 20:29.128
It’s no use. I’ll just...

20:30.130 --> 20:32.093
Hard to regenerate, isn’t it?

20:32.719 --> 20:38.105
Your regeneration slows considerably when
the cut sections are burned.

20:38.438 --> 20:42.321
I didn’t fiddle with your body
for ten years for nothing, you know.

20:43.574 --> 20:45.035
Undead.

20:45.494 --> 20:47.123
Nice weapon.

20:47.123 --> 20:50.337
No doubt it would’ve been effective on your “Andy”.

20:50.797 --> 20:53.468
But I can choose where I regenerate.

20:53.761 --> 20:55.724
If my body is no good...

20:57.309 --> 20:58.938
...then I’ll just swap to my finger.

21:01.652 --> 21:02.654
Hmm?

21:04.115 --> 21:08.123
Nothing... but brute force behind that swing.

21:08.583 --> 21:11.797
You... you’re an amateur at combat.

21:15.764 --> 21:18.310
If you value your ability,
keep your distance.

21:19.103 --> 21:21.984
Stay out of this,
and I’ll spare you from death.

21:34.008 --> 21:36.221
Shame about what happened to Unchange, but...

21:37.348 --> 21:41.189
I see now.
you guys are good.

22:00.979 --> 22:05.989
TO BE CONTINUED

23:36.002 --> 23:36.461
PREVIEW

23:36.795 --> 23:40.553
<i>The god of war has awoken.
In this battle where anyone can fall at any time,</i>

23:40.553 --> 23:45.062
<i>the girl’s glance never gives up
as she keeps calling the name of the undead man.</i>

23:45.354 --> 23:48.694
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 9-Return.</i>

23:48.819 --> 23:50.948
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
